\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Training and validation loss curves for the optimized pipeline. The rapid initial decrease reflects effective warm-up and the benefit of the pre-trained backbone. The growing train/validation gap after epoch~10 is a controlled overfitting effect, mitigated by balanced class weighting, encoder freezing, and multi-sample dropout. The model was selected at the epoch of best Macro-F1.}}{7}{}\protected@file@percent }
